\end_inset 

.
 
\begin_inset Formula \[
\lambda=\frac{0.9}{\bar{X}}.\]

\end_inset 


\layout Standard


\begin_inset Formula \[
3=\lambda\bar{W}.\]

\end_inset 


\layout Standard

Therefore 
\begin_inset Formula $\frac{\bar{W}}{\bar{X}}=3\frac{1}{3}$
\end_inset 

.
 
