Balance Equation
\layout Itemize

We can now derive the stationary distribution for this queue.
\layout Itemize

Balance equation for the 
\begin_inset Formula $M/M/1/m$
\end_inset 

 is identical to that for the 
\begin_inset Formula $M/M/1$
\end_inset 

